PASS modal: named dialog, initial focus, focus trap, Escape and focus restoration
PASS revoked account cannot be selected; unavailable accounts have accessible connect links
PASS schedule: accessible name, selected state, browser IANA timezone and local minimum
PASS 320px: publish modal fits, controls reachable, axe WCAG AA
PASS 375px: publish modal fits, controls reachable, axe WCAG AA
PASS 768px: publish modal fits, controls reachable, axe WCAG AA
PASS 1280px: publish modal fits, controls reachable, axe WCAG AA
PASS 1440px: publish modal fits, controls reachable, axe WCAG AA
PASS editing and resizing neither refetch accounts nor submit a draft
PASS unknown: safe useful response, uncertain submission cannot be retried
PASS lost: safe useful response, uncertain submission cannot be retried
PASS error: safe useful response, uncertain submission cannot be retried
PASS partial: successful destinations retained, retry targets only failed destinations, no raw diagnostic
PASS partial retry response lost: previous success retained and uncertain account not retried
PASS uncertain result survives close/reopen; reopening never resubmits
PASS targeted retry accepts full journal without duplicating a successful account
PASS accounts empty: safe state, no phantom destination, bounded request
PASS accounts expired: safe state, no phantom destination, bounded request
PASS accounts ambiguous: safe state, no phantom destination, bounded request
PASS accounts error: safe state, no phantom destination, bounded request
PASS accounts slow: safe state, no phantom destination, bounded request
PASS draft cancel preserves text; empty caption and past date send nothing
PASS Honolulu local time converts exactly to UTC; scheduled is not published
PASS Paris DST gap rejected; autumn fold displays and sends chosen UTC offset
PASS rapid double click sends one request and cannot dismiss an in-flight submission
PASS creation mode client: visible distinction, costs and no automatic generation
PASS creation mode unavailable: visible distinction, costs and no automatic generation
PASS creation mode ready: visible distinction, costs and no automatic generation
PASS runtime: no hydration/client error and no unmocked publication
